# `reinstall-xp-gate` is a SEPARATE skill, not part of xp-gate.
#
# It exists to uninstall and reinstall xp-gate, so it cannot ship inside the package
# it removes -- a skill that deletes its own directory mid-run has no defined state to
# continue from. Keeping it out of this repository keeps that boundary explicit rather
# than relying on nobody staging it.
skills/reinstall-xp-gate/
